#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:4
msgid ""
"The **ETL Pipelines** tab of a research project loads data into the "
"project automatically from files that arrive in a storage bucket, for "
"example a nightly export from a lab system. You decide which bucket to "
"watch and which script reads the files. From then on, every new file is "
"processed without anyone having to start it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:9
msgid "A few terms appear throughout this page:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:11
msgid "ETL Script"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:12
msgid ""
"A small program, written in Python or R, that reads the incoming files "
"and returns rows of data. Your project can have its own **custom** "
"scripts. Scripts provided by the platform are called **native** scripts. "
"They are read-only and available to every project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:16
msgid "Script Version"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:17
msgid ""
"A saved, unchangeable copy of a script. Uploading a changed script always"
" creates a new version, and older versions stay exactly as they were."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:20
msgid "ETL Datatype"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:21
msgid ""
"The kind of data a script produces, for example *measurement* or *visit "
"occurrence*. It decides which columns each row must have and where in the"
" database the rows are stored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:24
msgid "Pipeline Binding"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:25
msgid ""
"A connection between a **source bucket** (where files arrive) and one "
"Script Version. It also names the **raw bucket** that processed files are"
" moved to afterwards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:28
msgid "ETL Job"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:29
msgid "One run of a script over one file, or one folder of files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:32
msgid "Who can do what"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md
msgid "Role"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md
msgid "What you can do on the ETL Pipelines tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md
msgid "Admin"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md
msgid ""
"Everything below, plus archiving scripts and changing the project's "
"settings under **Defaults**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md
msgid "Data Manager"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md
msgid ""
"Create and edit custom scripts, upload new versions, create bindings, "
"retry failed jobs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md
msgid "PI, Investigator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md
msgid "See every section (scripts, bindings, jobs, logs) but change nothing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md
msgid "Other roles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md
msgid "The tab is not available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:41
msgid ""
"The tab has four sections, listed in the sidebar on its left: "
"**Bindings**, **Scripts**, **Jobs** and **Defaults**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:45
msgid "Creating a custom script"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:47
msgid "Open the **ETL Pipelines** tab and select **Scripts** in the sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:48
msgid ""
"Under **New script**, enter a **Name** and an optional **Description**, "
"choose the **Datatype** the script produces, and choose the script's "
"**Source** file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:50
msgid ""
"The Datatype can't be changed after the script is created, because "
"bindings and past jobs depend on it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:52
msgid ""
"The file must end in `.py` (Python) or `.R` (R). The ending decides which"
" language environment the script runs in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:54
msgid ""
"The file must not be larger than the project's size limit, 256 KB unless "
"an Admin has changed it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:56
msgid "Click **Create script**. The script appears in the list as version 1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:58
msgid ""
"To change the name or description, click **Edit** next to the script. To "
"change the code itself, use **Add version**, choose the new file and "
"click **Upload version**. Bindings that already use an older version "
"continue to use it. A new binding can use the new version right away. To "
"switch an existing binding to it, see [Editing a binding](#heading-etl-"
"pipelines-binding-edit)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:64
msgid ""
"An Admin can **Archive** a script that is no longer needed. An archived "
"script can no longer be edited or chosen for a new binding. Scripts are "
"never deleted, so every past job can still be traced to the exact code "
"that ran."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:68
msgid "The Scripts and Bindings lists show each script's Datatype."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:71
msgid "Native scripts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:73
msgid ""
"The **Scripts** section also lists the native scripts. You can choose "
"them directly when creating a binding. The platform currently provides "
"one:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:76
msgid ""
"**CSV → participant consent** reads consent form exports (by default the "
"SamtyckenUmu format) and records one consent for each consent marked "
"\"Ja\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:78
msgid ""
"People who aren't yet participants in your project are **added** "
"automatically, with a generated pseudonym."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:80
msgid ""
"A consent that is exported again is updated, so a later revocation is "
"recorded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:81
msgid ""
"If your export uses different column names, a different delimiter, or a "
"word other than \"Ja\", describe it in the binding's **Script config**. "
"The technical manual lists the keys."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:84
msgid ""
"To change how a native script works for your project, click **Customize**"
" next to it. This creates a custom copy in your project, which you can "
"then edit and version like any other custom script. The native script "
"itself, and other projects, are not affected. Your copy does not receive "
"later updates to the native script."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:90
msgid ""
"A script created before the Datatype became part of the form may show "
"**Datatype: not set**. Its jobs fail with a \"contract violation\" error "
"until a Datatype is chosen. Open **Edit** on the script, pick the "
"Datatype and click **Save**. This picker is offered only while the "
"Datatype is still unset."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:96
msgid "What a script has to do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:98
msgid ""
"A script receives the incoming files and the binding's settings. It "
"returns one row at a time, with the columns required by its Datatype. "
"Every row must identify the study participant it belongs to, either by "
"`person_source_value` or by `alias1`. The platform then checks each row "
"before anything is saved:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:103
msgid ""
"If **any** row is invalid, refers to an unknown participant, or matches "
"more than one participant, the whole job fails and **nothing** is saved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:105
msgid ""
"A script cannot reach the network, the database or any other system. It "
"can only read its input files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:107
msgid ""
"Running the same file again updates rows that were loaded earlier; it "
"does not create duplicates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:110
msgid ""
"Scripts run with limited time and memory. By default a run is stopped "
"after 10 minutes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:113
msgid "Creating a Pipeline Binding"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:115
msgid ""
"A binding tells the platform to watch a location and process what arrives"
" there."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:117
msgid "Open **Bindings** and expand **New binding**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:118
msgid "Fill in the form:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:119
msgid ""
"**Source bucket** and **Source prefix**: the bucket, and optionally the "
"folder inside it, where new files arrive."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:121
msgid "**Script & version**: the script to run and the exact version to use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:122
msgid ""
"**Raw bucket** and **Raw prefix**: where processed files are moved after "
"a successful job."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:124
msgid ""
"**Grouping**: **Per file** runs one job for each new file. **Folder, with"
" quiescence wait** waits until a folder has stopped receiving files, then"
" processes the whole folder as one job."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:127
msgid ""
"**Quiescence** (folder grouping only): how many seconds a folder must go "
"without a new file before it counts as complete. Leave it empty for the "
"default of 300 seconds (5 minutes)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:129
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Script config** (optional): settings passed to the script as a JSON "
"object, for example `{\"delimiter\": \";\"}`. Anything other than a JSON "
"object is rejected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:131
msgid ""
"**Sandbox overrides** (optional): a lower time limit (seconds), memory "
"limit (MB) or CPU limit (millicores) for this binding. These can only be "
"lower than the platform limits, never higher."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:134
msgid "Click **Create binding**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:136
msgid ""
"Your project can only use buckets it has been granted. If the form says "
"*\"This project has not been granted access to that source "
"bucket/prefix\"*, or if there is a notice that no buckets are granted "
"yet, ask your platform administrator to grant the bucket to the project. "
"Each source location can belong to only one binding."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:142
msgid "Editing a binding"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:144
msgid ""
"Admins and Data Managers can click **Edit** next to a binding to change "
"its script version, raw destination, grouping, quiescence, script config "
"or sandbox overrides. Click **Save** to apply. Every edit is recorded in "
"the project's audit log."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:148
msgid ""
"The **source bucket and prefix can't be changed**. To watch a different "
"location, create a new binding."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:150
msgid ""
"Jobs that are already queued or running keep the script version and "
"config they started with. The edit applies to jobs created afterwards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:152
msgid ""
"Changing the grouping also applies to files that have arrived but haven't"
" been processed yet. After a switch to folder grouping, their folders "
"start a fresh quiescence wait."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:156
msgid "What happens when a file arrives"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:158
msgid ""
"**Detection.** The platform checks every binding's source location about "
"every 30 seconds and notices new files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:160
msgid ""
"For a binding that processes each file on its own, a job is created for "
"the file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:161
msgid ""
"For a folder binding, the platform waits until no new file has arrived in"
" that folder for a while (5 minutes by default), then creates one job for"
" the whole folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:163
msgid ""
"**Queueing.** A binding runs only one job at a time. Other new files "
"wait, and are picked up one after another as earlier jobs finish."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:165
msgid ""
"**Running.** The script runs in an isolated environment. The job's status"
" changes from *Pending* to *Running*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:167
msgid ""
"**Loading.** If the script succeeds and every row passes the checks, all "
"rows are saved together and the job becomes *Succeeded*. Otherwise the "
"job becomes *Failed* and nothing is saved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:170
msgid ""
"**Moving the files.** After a successful job, the input files are moved "
"from the source bucket to the raw bucket, into a folder named after the "
"job. They are copied first, the copy is checked, and only then is the "
"original deleted. If the original repeatedly cannot be deleted, Admins "
"and Data Managers receive an email and the file is left where it is for "
"manual handling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../Users/jolu0013/Documents/UmU/Projekt/miqa-research/src/MiqaResearch/.claude/worktrees/manuals-254/src/MiqaResearch/documentation/manuals/user/src/etl-pipelines.md:176
msgid ""
"Files belonging to a failed job are **not** moved. They stay in the "
"source bucket."
msgstr ""

