msgid ""
"Retry fixes problems in the data or on the platform side. If the script "
"itself was wrong, retrying runs the same faulty version again. Upload a "
"corrected version first, then [edit the binding](#heading-etl-pipelines-"
"binding-edit) to use it. New files are then processed with it."
msgstr ""

